msgid "迭代方向与进入条件"
msgstr "Iteration directions and admission conditions"

msgid "当前迭代以{ref}`最终冷态生命周期基线 <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`、 真实测量和原退出条件为依据。完整策略保留在 [后续迭代与团队执行](../delivery/next-iterations.md)，逐项状态由 [原台账](ledgers.md)维护；本页提供任务入口，不重复更新状态。"
msgstr "The current iteration follows the {ref}`final cold-lifecycle baseline <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`, actual measurements and original exit conditions. The complete strategy remains in [subsequent iterations and team execution](../delivery/next-iterations.md), and the [original ledgers](ledgers.md) maintain individual statuses. This page provides task entry points without maintaining duplicate status."

msgid "顺序"
msgstr "Order"

msgid "工作"
msgstr "Work"

msgid "进入与退出条件的权威"
msgstr "Authority for admission and exit conditions"

msgid "软件优先"
msgstr "Software first"

msgid "完善当前证据导航、交付工具和高级外部 recipe；按相同覆盖测量工具成本"
msgstr "Improve current evidence navigation, delivery tools and advanced external recipes; measure tool costs under identical coverage"

msgid "{ref}`封存基线与开放退出 <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`，现有 CLI、SDK 及外部示例合同"
msgstr "{ref}`Sealed baseline and open exits <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`, existing CLI, SDK and external examples contracts"

msgid "实板接入后"
msgstr "After board connection"

msgid "接入首发三板、来源参考板的真实 station，校准安全初值与 clock"
msgstr ""
"Connect real stations for the three initial and source-reference boards; "
"calibrate safe initial levels and clocks"

msgid "[HIL 状态](hardware.md)、原 station／qualification 合同"
msgstr ""
"[HIL status](hardware.md) and original station/qualification contracts"

msgid "随后测量"
msgstr "Then measure"

msgid "测量已有 IRQ／DMA／连续流／取消排空模式及完整负载退出"
msgstr ""
"Measure existing IRQ/DMA/continuous-stream/cancellation-drain modes and "
"full-load shutdown"

msgid "原 I/O、OS 和 SoC 台账，以及同一 candidate 的真实 traces"
msgstr ""
"Original I/O, OS and SoC ledgers, and real traces for the same candidate"

msgid "按测量扩展"
msgstr "Expand according to measurements"

msgid "新 controller／route、H743 更广 DMA／Cache、U575 DMA／安全域"
msgstr ""
"New controllers/routes, broader H743 DMA/Cache and U575 DMA/security domains"

msgid "[SoC 原退出条件](ledgers/soc-refinement.md)，每个切片先固定所有权与失败合同"
msgstr ""
"[Original SoC exit conditions](ledgers/soc-refinement.md); first freeze "
"ownership and failure contracts for each slice"

msgid "独立设计"
msgstr "Design separately"

msgid "更广的运行态交接、DVFS、通用 deep STOP、userspace I/O transport"
msgstr "Broader runtime handoff, DVFS, general deep STOP and userspace I/O transport"

msgid "原 SOC-33–35 的完整退出仍开放；已有 H743 RAM 维护和 U575 选定 Stop2 切片不代表通用支持"
msgstr "Full original SOC-33–35 exits remain open; existing H743 RAM maintenance and selected U575 Stop2 slices do not establish general support"

msgid "维护交付"
msgstr "Maintain delivery"

msgid "工具、依赖、SDK、文档发布与恢复"
msgstr "Tools, dependencies, SDK, documentation publication and recovery"

msgid "各原台账及精确源执行记录，软件／发布／物理分别验收"
msgstr ""
"Original ledgers and exact-source execution records; accept "
"software/publication/physical scope separately"

msgid ""
"Codex 负责所有维护领域，角色划分用于能力与容量安排，不需要虚构个人账号。 本地 ownership 文件不证明远程 GitHub branch "
"rules 已启用。高风险改动保留独立审查， 新增行为与缺陷修复先真实 RED，再 GREEN，C 合同使用 "
"GoogleTest／GoogleMock。 产品任务、恢复、安全升级、制造密钥与专有 PCB 位于外部工程。"
msgstr ""
"Codex owns all maintenance domains; role divisions allocate capabilities and"
" capacity without inventing personal accounts. Local ownership files do not "
"prove remote GitHub branch rules are enabled. Retain independent review for "
"high-risk changes. New behavior and bug fixes require actual RED before "
"GREEN, with GoogleTest/GoogleMock for C contracts. Product tasks, recovery, "
"secure updates, manufacturing keys and proprietary PCBs belong in external "
"projects."
